      "experiment_id": "exp_1",
      "description": "Variational Quantum Circuit (VQC) fraud-detection experiments on reduced transaction datasets, comparing basic entangling layer and strongly entangling layer ansatzes with multiple angle-encoding strategies and optional re-uploading, trained and validated on a PennyLane simulator and then evaluated on a real IBM device for one selected configuration.",
      "algorithm": {
